			"Message": "refactor(Rest): Remove dead code and unused dependencies from binary commands\n\nStrip unused imports and variables across the Rest element's Rust source files to clean up the codebase. Specifically, remove unused `tokio::sync::mpsc` channels in `Parallel.rs`, unused `rayon` imports, and dead code blocks in `Sequential.rs`, `Entry.rs`, and `Compile.rs` that were likely remnants of previous iterations or debugging (e.g., print statements, unused channel receivers).\n\nAdditionally, update `bin/Rest.js` to adhere to project style guidelines by switching to double quotes and consistent formatting. These changes reduce compiler warnings and improve maintainability without altering runtime behavior.",
